ind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.0.50","summary":"Hiya managers!We just put up a lil' patch with fixes! As always, notes marked with 🐱 are based on community suggestions! Hope you're having fun with the demo!!-Rick from Roost GamesPatch Notes:🐱 FIX: The 'demo complete' UI is now controller-supported.🐱 FIX: If using controller, the UI when finding recipes now properly shows controller buttons.🐱 FIX: Changed 'Sink' description, so it no longer mentions giving water to cats, which isn't implemented (yet? maybe? 👀)🐱 FIX: When using controller, the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:29:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027842","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:08:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1846651706691106","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🌟CCM2 launches on... November 25th!","summary":"Hi friend, September flew by, and we're already halfway through October. 😮‍💨🍂 That means it's time for another update! Let's get right into it with the most important news we have for you:🌟CCM2 launches on... November 25th!The cat's out of the bag! Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss will launch in Early Access on Steam this fall, on November 25, 2026! 😻If you're a Kickstarter backer entitled to a CCM2 Steam key, you'll receive it on launch day. That way, you'll be able to welcome customers and s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:32:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691106","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1844751498234326","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"💗September News: CCM2 Demo News & Early Access Launch Window Reveal!","summary":"Hey friend!🐈We hope you’ve had a great month of September so far! We've been incredibly busy since the demo launch in August, which is why this newsletter has taken a bit more time to put together than usual. But trust us, it's for good reason. We're making great progress on the game!😻 We've got quite a few important development updates and announcements to share, so this update is a big one. But first things first...💗THANK YOU SO SO MUCH!!! 💗Launching the first demo of Cat Cafe Manager 2 to the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T13:53:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234326","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1840944183788570","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 2 - v1.0.41","summary":"Hi again lovely managers!A little patch here to solve some potentially game-breaking issues folks have run into!Thanks SO MUCH everyone for giving us your bug reports, feedback & ideas: it's helping us a lot with the ongoing work on Cat Cafe Manager 2! 🐈Demo Patch 2As always, points marked with 🐱 are fixes suggested / discovered by the community!🐱 Fixed an issue where transitions between scenes wouldn't trigger, and you could 'fall outside of the world'.🐱 Fixed an issue where you could lose furn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T11:43:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788570","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1840310314344871","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1 - v1.0.40","summary":"Meowdy!Rick here, creative director on Cat Cafe Manager 2.First of all, in case you hadn't heard, we released a playable demo of CCM2 yesterday! You can download it from the main store page: Demo Patch 1We've already got some bug reports and quality of life requests from, well, you all! And we took some time today to see to them. Any points marked with a 😺 come from community suggestions! Here's what's changed:The lighting in your neighbors shops has been fixed, so it's not super dark in there a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T12:30:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344871","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1840310314342561","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"💗✨ The CCM2 Demo is OUT NOW!!","summary":"🐈 Dear community,IT'S HERE!🙀 To kick off our participation in The Wholesome Games Steam Celebration, we just launched our PUBLIC DEMO for Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss! Get comfy and try your hand (or paw?🐾) at running your very own cat cafe - for free, and as often as you like! 🩷 Along with the demo, we’ve also put together a BRAND NEW TRAILER for the game! Take a peek below and let us know what you think! Oh, and don't forget to share it with friends and family who love cozy games as much","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T16:57:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342561","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1839676055895055","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"😻the CCM2 DEMO goes LIVE on August 6th!!✨","summary":"Hey friend!🐈 Buckle up, we've got some BIG news to share today: We will launch the official \"Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss\" DEMO on STEAM this Thursday!!😻😻🎉🎉For the very first time, anyone - backer or not - will be able to give a career as a cat cafe manager in Covestadt a try!🥰 If you have any friends or family members who love cats and cozy games (almost) as much as you do, this is their chance to try a little slice of CCM2 with you!🍰☕ The demo goes live on August 6 at 10:00 AM PT / 1:00 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T15:25:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1839041357038543","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🩷 The CCM2 Playtest is full! More news very soon!","summary":"‼️ EDIT: the CCM2 playtest is already full! Thanks for your enthusiastic response! 🙏 🐈 Dear community,We have some exciting news to share! We just launched the very first public playtest for Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss! Yesterday, our Kickstarter backers could already get an early look into the game, and now it's your turn!❣️Requirements for being a playtester:Having a Steam account.PC only for this playtest.Signing a Non-Disclosure Agreement. In order to be able to, you must be over 18 y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T15:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038543","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1835236783573788","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🧡 June News: UI Deep Dive + Summer Hype","summary":"🐈Hi friend, We hope you're doing well.🩷 June is in full swing (can you believe half a year has passed already?!), which means it's time for another newsletter about the development of Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss!This month, we're shining a spotlight on a silent but key aspect of any good game: the User Interface.✨Let's get right into it!🤸💖UI Deep DiveA good UI (User Interface) often goes unnoticed, but funnily enough, that's exactly the goal. It's a very important aspect of game developme","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T10:39:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783573788","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1832065502814810","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 CCM2 is nominated to the Cozy Game Awards! Vote until May 10th!","summary":"Dear community,we are very proud to share that Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss has been nominated to the Cozy Games Awards in the \"Most Anticipated Game\" category!Voting is open now to the public, until May 10th: https://forms.gle/MEy6PjK5BGuUdu6d8 It would mean a lot if you could vote for us 🫶Wishing you all a fantastic weekend!We will be back next month with the June newsletter!-Irene (and the rest of Roost Games🪺)Connect with us:💜Discord💙BlueSky❤️Instagram🧡Reddit💛TikTok💚Newsletter Don't fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T11:32:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502814810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1829528821317900","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"😽🎂April News: Special Voice Actors + Visiting Shops","summary":"Hi friend!🥰If you celebrated, we want to wish you a happy belated Easter!🌼 It's time for another update on Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss. We've got quite a bit to dive into, so let's cut right to the chase in this April newsletter. But first, let's roll in the cake, light the candles, and start awkwardly singing, because...🐾 🎂Cat Cafe Manager Turns 4 Years Old Today!!🍰The first installment of Cat Cafe Manager was released on April 14th, 2022, debuting as our team’s very first game. Back the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T14:01:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821317900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1824644522839688","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🐈🎵 February News: Making Tunes & Crafting UI","summary":"🙋Hi friend! We hope you had a wonderful start to 2026.🩷 With the beta version of the game on the horizon, it's all paws on deck here at Roost Games!🐾 🎮 Beta Testing Is Around The Corner!We've made huge progress with the Beta version of the game and we are planning to run the Beta Tests with 317 Kickstarter backers next month! We are very excited for this milestone and will keep everyone updated on how that goes! 🫶🎵Making MeowsicEvery game needs a good soundtrack. We want you to enjoy relaxing mu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-13T15:38:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522839688","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1819386365096131","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🎅🏻December News: The CCM2 Wish List!🎁","summary":"Hello, hello, hellooo!🐈It's hard to believe this year is almost over, isn't it?🫨For us, 2025 has been the year we truly got to dive into the creation of Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss. After a successful Kickstarter campaign around the end of 2024, we kicked off 2025 with big plans, ambitious goals, and tons of inspiration. And honestly, we’ve made huge leaps since then!💛🌷Stop & Smell the FlowersOver the past month, we’ve been working hard to breathe more life into the streets of Covestadt. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-19T16:29:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365096131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1815580768428844","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🧡🏠 November News: Shaping up Limeline Village!","summary":"Hi friend!🐈With Halloween officially behind us, we are now venturing into the last stretch of 2025. Luckily for us, the thrill of Halloween is never truly over. Whether it's October, December, or even July - in the world of Cat Cafe Manager 2, there will always be friendly witches to meet, magical places to discover, whimsical potions to drink, and fantastical cats to love!✨🐈‍⬛🧙‍♀️That's why we're super excited to share something extra special with you today. Behind the scenes, we've been workin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-11T16:10:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768428844","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1809869180073607","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🩷🍴September News: Inventing Whimsical Kitchen Appliances","summary":"Hi there, purring pal🐈! It's September, which means it's time for a brand new newsletter!🩷First and foremost, we want to thank everyone who shared their thoughts, excitement, and questions so far. It's very helpful for us to hear how you feel about our still developing game. Keep in mind that everything we show in our newsletters is still a work in progress. 👷🛠️🏊‍♀️Concept Artist Deep DiveFor this Deep Dive, we'd like to give the mic to Esmeé, one of our talented game artists. She's been busy de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-05T17:28:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809869180073607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1807332909577080","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"😻August News: Kittens And A Fresh Look For Our Cats!!","summary":"Hi friends!🐈We hope July has been good to you! Here at Roost Games, we had a great month. We worked on some really cool new stuff we know you're going to love. Seriously, we're so excited to talk about our cutest CCM2 feature yet. Prepare yourself for some serious baby fever, because...🍼Cat Cafe Manager 2 will have KITTENS!Whereas cat cafes in the original Cat Cafe Manager were only inhabited by grown cats, things will be a little different in your city establishment in Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-07T17:10:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909577080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1801617199459053","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"🌼June News: Wildwoud Woods Concept Art + Decorating Your Cafe!","summary":"Hi there, fellow cat enthusiasts!🩷🐈 June has officially kicked off, so we want to begin by saying that we hope everyone had a wonderful month of May!🌸 Let's start the month off strong by getting you up to speed with the latest Cat Cafe Manager 2 updates!😸 🦉Welcome to the Wildwoud Woods! Are you ready to call your fearless feline companion and explore the magical Wildwoud Woods, just outside the city?✨ Who knows, you might just find that rare ingredient you’ve been searching for forever, hiding i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-07T13:24:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199459053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1795917897329196","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"April News: Limeline Village + New Team Members! 🌸","summary":"Hi friends! Here's a little update on what we have been up to since the last update: 💛 Art Update Over the past month, the art team has been working hard to bring a brand new in-game area to life: Limeline Village. It will be located in the historical heart of Covestadt, the main city of Cat Cafe Manager 2. Limeline Village will be shaped by old colorful buildings and charming alleyways, overgrown with greenery for you to explore. You will be able to take pleasant strolls along the canals and pe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-03T15:38:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795917897329196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1790214123118910","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"January News: Kickstarter and development progress! 💚","summary":"Hi friends! We hope your first month of 2025 has been great!🩷 With January almost over, we would love to fill you in on everything new with the development of Cat Cafe Manager 2: Big City Bliss! 💚Kickstarter Updates This month, we officially closed late pledges for Kickstarter after collecting a total of €93,370 from 2,151 backers. Thank you so much everyone!💜 🧡Our producer Joni has been busy setting up an organized distribution system to prepare all physical rewards for shipment for Kickstarter","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-31T15:46:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1790214123118910","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-1785774543689061","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"December News: 🎨 Cozy Sketches! And Happy Holidays! 💝","summary":"Hi friends! As we’re fast approaching the end of the year, we want to share 🎨a little peek behind the curtains to show you what our artists have been up to! 🎨Dev Update Since our little break in October, we’ve been making really good progress on the development side and cannot wait to show you more soon! For now, we have asked our lead artist Carmen to share what the art department has been working on the past few weeks: \"What is the best way to set up an environment for a game such as Cat Cafe ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-12-17T14:53:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1785774543689061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3109590-6146943657173872931","game_id":"steam-3109590","kind":"announcement","title":"October News : Wrapping up the Kickstarter... Back to development!","summary":"Hello everyone! We’re back from vacation, bursting with energy, and excited to start sending out Kickstarter rewards and continue working on Cat Cafe Manager 2! ✨ On Kickstarter, we managed to collect a whopping 88,957 EUR from 2,063 backers - thank you all SO SO much! With this money, we won't just be able to create the game of our dreams; we will also be in the position to add the following Stretch Goals: Customizing your cafe’s outside, Cat Connections, Romanceable NPCs, and Kittens! 😻 {STEAM","occurred_at":null,"publish